Independent full-diff review returned **INCOMPLETE** because the repaired candidate has not received authenticated rendered review. The candidate launch’s Member handoff read was denied. Its later sanitized cleanup record reports verified removal, but a required harmless-marker write to the approved channel was denied, so I did not try another transport or browser run.

I marked IMP-004 `[!]`, appended the requested summary to `DONE.md`, and stopped dependent work. **No commit, push, or PR** was made. Owner-approved channel access and a new recovery decision are needed before rendered review, docs, final gates, and delivery can finish.
